{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Tower Bound by Gods. A Defender Bound by Duty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Runic Tower</i> is a 3rd-person roguelike tower defense game where you fight to protect a living tower from relentless invaders. When the tower falls, the cycle begins again \u2014 each run forging new strategies, unlocking powers, and unveiling the dark forces behind the siege.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Defend in Depth</strong> \u2013 Face waves of cunning enemies, from agile bandits to ritual-bound monstrosities, each with unique AI behaviors, abilities, and tactics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/eb6372f04fb3c4c3cadce95f52373c79.poster.avif?t=1757934860\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/eb6372f04fb3c4c3cadce95f52373c79.webm?t=1757934860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/eb6372f04fb3c4c3cadce95f52373c79.mp4?t=1757934860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f Evolve Your Arsenal</strong> \u2013 Discover, combine, and upgrade abilities through a modular system designed for experimentation \u2014 or break the rules entirely with rare, reality-bending runes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/386c5a17f73200adaca5d61bdc8eea2d.poster.avif?t=1757934860\" width=800 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/386c5a17f73200adaca5d61bdc8eea2d.webm?t=1757934860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/386c5a17f73200adaca5d61bdc8eea2d.mp4?t=1757934860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf3fA Living World</strong> \u2013 Every faction tells a story through combat. Bandits cut deals in the shadows, cultists bind horrors to their will, and monstrous Covenant creatures stalk the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/5354baffdd53bfc81a65e7d54a827f3f.avif?t=1757934860\" data-has-big width=1560 height=646 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u267b\ufe0f Die, Learn, Repeat</strong> \u2013 Runs end when the tower is destroyed, not when you fall. Return to the fight with new upgrades, meta-progression, and knowledge of your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/2ca56efd48503ceada59442dcc2a171f.poster.avif?t=1757934860\" width=800 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/2ca56efd48503ceada59442dcc2a171f.webm?t=1757934860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/2ca56efd48503ceada59442dcc2a171f.mp4?t=1757934860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3rd-person roguelike tower defense hybrid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly modular ability system with endless build possibilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct enemy factions with unique AI and tactics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless ability synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric, lore-rich world with dark fantasy and Lovecraftian undertones</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every wishlist helps! Wishlist Runic Tower today, and tell your friends!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Discord for Developer Updates &amp; Input on new abilities, enemies and lore!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/extras/ea4eb6845ee4ca5d60db366ee94f9f3c.avif?t=1757934860\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949420?t=1757934860","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3949420?t=1757934860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/e7c9dcfb0fa49dea151b1627b064a90245ef1eb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757934860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3949420/e7c9dcfb0fa49dea151b1627b064a90245ef1eb7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757934860","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game will have spells and abilities which harm enemies in the game. This can vary from explosions, magical missiles and deadly venoms."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Tower Bound by Gods. A Defender Bound by Duty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Runic Tower</i> is a 3rd-person roguelike tower defense game where you fight to prot